    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d19-a1">

                <pb facs="0093" n="23" sameAs="frus:frus1867p2/pg23"/>

                <head>[Translation.]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <date calendar="gregorian japanese-nengō" when="1867-02-03"><hi
                                rendition="#small-caps">29th of 12th Month, 2d Year of Kaion,</hi>
                                (<hi rendition="#italic">February</hi> 3, 1867.)</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>We have the honor to inform you that we concluded the treaty with Denmark.</p>
                <p>With respect and regard,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>INO NE YE KAWATSI NO KAMI.</signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed>INABA NUIRO NO KAMI.</signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed>MATSUDAIRA INO NO KAMI.</signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed>OGASAWARA IKI NO KAMI.</signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>His Excellency <hi rendition="#small-caps">R. B. Van Valkenburgh,</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Minister Resident of the United States.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
